{"key": "r09", "title": "Worship With Understanding", "subtitle": "A saying of 'Ali on reading without reflecting", "trigger_at": "2026-12-22T13:00:00.000Z", "body": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "captionedImage", "content": [{"type": "image2", "__img": "cover-r09.png", "alt": "Worship With Understanding"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A well-known saying is reported from 'Ali ibn Abi Talib, may Allah be pleased with him:"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In Arabic: \"أَلَا لَا خَيْرَ فِي عِبَادَةٍ لَيْسَ فِيهَا تَفَقُّهٌ، وَلَا عِلْمٍ لَيْسَ فِيهِ تَفَهُّمٌ، وَلَا قِرَاءَةٍ لَيْسَ فِيهَا تَدَبُّرٌ\""}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Beware: there is no good in worship without understanding of the religion, nor in knowledge without real understanding, nor in reading without reflection.\"", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (Reported by ad-Darimi.)"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Three key words"}]}, {"type": "bullet_list", "content": [{"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Understanding of the deen:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " تَفَقُّه ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "tafaqquh", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), from the same root as "}, {"type": "text", "text": "fiqh", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Real understanding:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " تَفَهُّم ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "tafahhum", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), working hard to grasp something."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reflection:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " تَدَبُّر ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "tadabbur", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), thinking about where a thing leads. Allah asks: أَفَلَا يَتَدَبَّرُونَ الْقُرْآنَ \"Do they not reflect on the Qur'an?\" (4:82)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Understand your deen and your worship, and think about what the Qur'an is saying to you. Learn Arabic, or at least read with a translation and stop to think. That is the way out of the difficulty our Ummah is in."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Download this post as a PDF", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", with all the Arabic in Qur'anic script: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Worship With Understanding (PDF)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://www.seemabooks.com/downloads/substack-posts/r09-worship-with-understanding.pdf", "target": "_blank", "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow", "class": null}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "First shared on Instagram: ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "@ibnqutb", "marks": [{"type": "em"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CwK7fWYO8mI/", "target": "_blank", "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow", "class": null}}]}]}]}}